[78.205429, "o", "\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m------------------\u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m-----------\u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[78.205467, "o", "\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m Aristotle Tympas \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m GR        \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m Full prof; NKUA (GR); STS101 department has 12 currently-enrolled students                           \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[78.205634, "o", "\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m Orfeas Menis     \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m GR, US    \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m Full prof; ComputerScience_NTUA (GR) has 12 current enrollees in CS101; also works at Sloan_MIT (US) \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m Pepe Attanasio   \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m PT, GR    \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\u001b[37m Full prof; IST (PT) + NTUA (GR); CS_NTUA has 12 current enrollees                                    \u001b[0m\u001b[37m|\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[78.205692, "o", "\u001b[37mExcluded: Athanasios Voulodimos and Stefan Mueller (assistant professors), John Smith (MIT/Biology is US-only), Marie Dubois (Sorbonne Math201 has only 6 currently enrolled — 14 total, but 8 already graduated).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
